Description:
	HIL bring-up TestRun for the Speedgoat XCP path (ECU SpeedgoatVirtualVCU).
	Straight road, no driver longitudinal command: the maneuver holds Gas and
	Brake at 0 so the ONLY writer of VehicleControl.Gas / VehicleControl.Brake
	is the XCP STIM path from the Speedgoat. Vehicle is a 4-motor BEV so the
	PT.Motor{,1,2,3}.{Trq,rotv} and PT.PwrSupply.HV1.Pwr dictionary quantities
	that TorqueVect.mdl reads actually exist.
	Expect zero wheel torque while the VCU drive gate is off.
